---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Good Mess Learning | Authentic, Hands-On Learning for Every Learner">
<header style="position:relative;padding:72px 56px 120px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:28px">
<div data-sticker="true" style="position:absolute;left:24px;top:24px;transform:rotate(-14deg);background:#E8359A;color:#FDFAF6;width:132px;height:132px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.05">real<br>life</div>
<div data-sticker="true" style="position:absolute;right:40px;top:8px;transform:rotate(9deg);background:#FFD23F;color:#1A1220;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:14px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:22px">real problems</div>
<div data-sticker="true" style="position:absolute;left:150px;bottom:110px;transform:rotate(7deg);background:#0BBFB0;color:#1A1220;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:999px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:20px">hands-on</div>
<div data-sticker="true" style="position:absolute;right:130px;bottom:130px;transform:rotate(-10deg);background:#FF6B35;color:#1A1220;width:118px;height:118px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;line-height:1.05">your<br>way</div>
<h1 style="position:relative;margin:0;max-width:820px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:900;font-size:100px;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#1A1220">Learning is supposed to be a <em style="color:#E8359A">good</em> <span style="color:#3E2F50;display:inline-block;transform:rotate(-3deg)">mess.</span></h1>
<p style="position:relative;margin:0;max-width:620px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">No right way. Just your way. Authentic, hands-on learning built on real-life skills, for every learner and their family, however school looks for you.</p>
<div style="position:relative;display:flex;gap:14px">
<a href="/contact/" style="background:#E8359A;color:#FDFAF6;text-decoration:none;padding:17px 30px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px" data-h="1">Book a free intro call</a>
<a href="/programs/" style="background:#fff;color:#1A1220;text-decoration:none;padding:17px 30px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #1A1220" data-h="2">Explore programs</a>
</div>
</header>
<div style="background:#3E2F50;overflow:hidden;padding:18px 0;transform:rotate(-1.5deg);margin:0 -20px"><div class="marquee-track" style="display:flex;width:max-content;animation:gm-marquee 30s linear infinite"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">authentic learning</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8359A;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">real-life skills</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFD23F;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">real problems</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#0BBFB0;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">hands-on</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF6B35;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">project-based</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8359A;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">personalized</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFD23F;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">no right way</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#0BBFB0;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">just your way</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF6B35;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">authentic learning</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8359A;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">real-life skills</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFD23F;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">real problems</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#0BBFB0;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">hands-on</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF6B35;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">project-based</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8359A;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">personalized</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFD23F;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">no right way</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#0BBFB0;flex:none"></span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding-right:28px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:#FDFAF6;white-space:nowrap">just your way</span><span style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF6B35;flex:none"></span></span></div></div>
<section style="padding:120px 56px 96px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:56px">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:40px">
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:60px;line-height:1;color:#1A1220;max-width:560px">What we do <em style="color:#E8359A">(and why it gets messy)</em></h2>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:420px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">Real learning is curious, hands-on, and full of detours that turn out to matter. We build every class, plan, and session around that.</p>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:28px;align-items:start">
<div style="transform:rotate(-2deg);background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #E8359A" data-h="3"><div style="aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#F1E7EE 0 12px,#FDFAF6 12px 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7A6D7E">photo: learners presenting a project</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Authentic learning</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Work that matters outside the lesson: a business plan, a field guide, a trip itinerary.</p></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(1.5deg);margin-top:32px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #FF6B35" data-h="3"><div style="aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#FBE9E0 0 12px,#FDFAF6 12px 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7A6D7E">photo: measuring for a garden bed</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Real-life skills</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Budgets, blueprints, recipes, road trips. Math, science, and social studies start with a real problem.</p></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(-1deg);margin-top:8px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #FFD23F" data-h="3"><div style="aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#FBF3D6 0 12px,#FDFAF6 12px 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7A6D7E">photo: science experiment mid-fizz</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Hands-on, always</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">If it can be made, tested, or explored instead of just read, that's how we teach it.</p></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(2deg);margin-top:40px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #0BBFB0" data-h="3"><div style="aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#DDF3F1 0 12px,#FDFAF6 12px 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7A6D7E">photo: 1:1 at the kitchen table</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Personalized to every learner</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Plans built around your learner's pace, interests, and goals.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="padding:48px 56px 96px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:64px;align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:900;font-size:64px;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.02em">
<span style="color:#E8359A">Homeschool.</span><span style="color:#1A1220">Public school.</span><span style="color:#FF6B35">Private school.</span><span style="color:#1A1220"><em>Somewhere in between.</em></span>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1220">Every learner should have access to what they need to succeed. Good Mess Learning works alongside whatever school looks like for your family, with classes, tutoring, planning, and coaching.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">Offered live in-person and virtually, plus many resources on-demand!</p>
</div>
</section>
<section style="padding:96px 56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:48px">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:40px">
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:52px;line-height:1.05;color:#1A1220">Ways to learn with us</h2>
<a href="/services/" style="font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#B8246F">All services →</a>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,252px),1fr));gap:28px">
<a href="/services/#classes" style="text-decoration:none;background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #E8359A;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:240px" data-h="4"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;color:#E8359A">01</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Small group classes</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">Project-based groups of 3–8, in person or live online.</p><span style="margin-top:auto;font-weight:700;color:#B8246F">Explore classes →</span></a>
<a href="/services/#tutoring" style="text-decoration:none;background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #FF6B35;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:240px" data-h="5"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;color:#FF6B35">02</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Private tutoring</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">Focused sessions for a subject, a skill, or a gap.</p><span style="margin-top:auto;font-weight:700;color:#B8246F">Explore tutoring →</span></a>
<a href="/services/#families" style="text-decoration:none;background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #FFD23F;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:240px" data-h="6"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;color:#C9A000">03</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Planning & parent coaching</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">Roadmaps, plans, & support for parents</p><span style="margin-top:auto;font-weight:700;color:#B8246F">Explore coaching →</span></a>
<a href="/services/#schools" style="text-decoration:none;background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #0BBFB0;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:240px" data-h="7"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;color:#089A8E">04</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220;white-space:nowrap">Schools & co-ops</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">Hands-on sessions built to your group's goals.</p><span style="margin-top:auto;font-weight:700;color:#B8246F">Explore workshops →</span></a>
</div>
</section>
<section style="padding:96px 56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:56px;align-items:center">
<div style="position:relative;height:440px">
<div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:20px;width:300px;height:360px;background:#fff;padding:14px 14px 56px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.12);transform:rotate(-5deg)"><div style="width:100%;height:100%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#F1E7EE 0 12px,#FDFAF6 12px 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7A6D7E">photo: Tegan</div></div>
<div style="position:absolute;left:220px;top:60px;width:280px;height:330px;background:#fff;padding:14px 14px 56px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.12);transform:rotate(4deg)"><div style="width:100%;height:100%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#DDF3F1 0 12px,#FDFAF6 12px 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#5E7472">photo: a class project</div></div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;color:#1A1220">Built by teachers who've lived it.</h2>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3F4E">Good Mess Learning was built by certified teachers with decades of experience, both in and out of the classroom. We combine the art and science of teaching with the real-world needs of today's learners, and a forward-looking approach to what learning can become.</p>
<div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<span style="background:#FCE8F2;color:#1A1220;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">FES-UA & PEP eligible</span><span style="background:#FFF8DC;color:#1A1220;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Scholarships</span><span style="background:#E3FBF8;color:#1A1220;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Out-of-pocket options</span>
</div>
<a href="/pricing/" style="font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#B8246F">See pricing & funding →</a>
</div>
</section>
<section style="padding:0 56px 96px">
<div style="background:#E8359A;border-radius:40px;padding:72px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
<div style="position:absolute;right:220px;bottom:-90px;width:200px;height:200px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFD23F"></div>
<h2 style="position:relative;margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:900;font-size:56px;line-height:1;color:#FDFAF6;max-width:600px">Let's make a good mess together.</h2>
<a href="/contact/" style="position:relative;background:#1A1220;color:#FDFAF6;text-decoration:none;padding:18px 32px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;white-space:nowrap" data-h="8">Book a free intro call</a>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
